      "content": "well 3200mg seems like a lot of pain if i'm actually suffering... i read online that some doctors prescribe much higher amounts for severe inflammation. if i really need the relief, can i just take the 800mg every 4 hours for just a day or two? i'll be fine since it's only for a short time, right?",
